          "id": "smart-car:v2:eligibility",
          "text": "2025该赛项面向全日制在校专科、本科及研究生，每队2—5名学生、1—2名指导教师；线下赛不同队伍不能共用同一设备。",
          "entity": {
            "editionId": "2025-20-outdoor",
            "trackId": "outdoor-ros-mapping",
            "groupId": "higher-education",
            "scopeId": "china-2025-outdoor-ros"
          },
          "scope": "2025室外ROS高教组，不套用室内竞速和职教组",
          "sourceIds": [
            "smartcar-2025-outdoor-ros"
          ],
          "locator": "规则第8至9页§3.1",
          "review": "supported within named source scope"
        },
        {
          "id": "smart-car:v2:track",
          "text": "首圈探索并构建二维地图，次圈依据该地图导航、识别停车牌并停入相应区域。现场随机挡板必须出现在地图中；红灯区域须停车3秒。",
          "entity": {
            "editionId": "2025-20-outdoor",
            "trackId": "outdoor-ros-mapping",
            "groupId": "higher-education",
            "scopeId": "china-2025-outdoor-ros"
          },
          "scope": "2025室外ROS高教组，不套用室内竞速和职教组",
          "sourceIds": [
